干预:
OTHER: The Labor Hopscotch

Labor Hopscotch consists of 4 basic parameters including movement (mobilization), positioning (birth stool, sitting on the toilet, birth ball, birth mat), water therapy and non-pharmacological methods for reducing pain. There are sub-contents for each of these parameters and hopscotch consists of 7 steps in total. Labor Hopscotch Model Steps;

Step 1: Mobilization (squat, pelvic tilt, using stairs, movement) Step 2: Birth Stool (oral fluid support, massage, breathing techniques) Step 3: Sitting on the Toilet (urinating, dim lighting, music) Step 4: Water Therapy (Warm shower, breathing techniques, Squat, oral fluid support) Step 5: Birth Ball (drawing 8 with the birth ball, slow movement techniques) Step 6: Birth Mat (massage, exercise on the mat, quadruped position) Step 7: Alternative Methods (massage, aromatherapy).

