8. History of or suspected pneumonitis, interstitial lung disease, or other pulmonary conditions that may interfere with pulmonary function assessment;
9. Active autoimmune disease or history of autoimmune disease. Patients with hypothyroidism controlled by hormone replacement therapy, vitiligo, or resolved childhood asthma requiring no treatment in adulthood may be eligible. Patients requiring bronchodilator treatment are excluded;
