11. Significant cardiovascular disease, including myocardial ischemia or infarction, uncontrolled arrhythmia (QTc ≥450 ms in males or ≥470 ms in females), heart failure of NYHA class II or higher, left ventricular ejection fraction \ 3 × ULN, history of severe bleeding events, or arterial or venous thromboembolic events;
13. History of allogeneic organ transplantation or allogeneic hematopoietic stem cell transplantation;
